{
  "id": "piranport:skin_core",
  "items": [
    "piranport:skin_core_4",
    "piranport:skin_core_18"
  ],
  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：皮肤核心",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Skin Core"
  },
  "tags": ["piranport", "skin", "cosmetic"],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "apply_skin",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "潜行右键换肤",
        "en_us": "Sneak-Click to Apply"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "item": "piranport:skin_core_4",
          "pos": [2, 1, 2]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "皮肤核心是变身皮肤的载体——大凤、独角兽等各舰娘皮肤各对应一枚核心，物品提示里写着皮肤名。",
            "en_us": "A Skin Core carries one transformation skin — Taihou, Unicorn and the others each have their own core, named right in the tooltip."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.2, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "show_controls",
          "duration": 80,
          "point": [2.5, 2.0, 2.5],
          "direction": "up",
          "action": "right",
          "item": "piranport:skin_core_4",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "手持皮肤核心潜行右键，应用该外观并消耗核心；普通右键不会应用。",
            "en_us": "Hold a skin core and sneak-right-click to apply its appearance and consume the core. Plain right-click does not apply it."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.6, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "双手空置时潜行右键可恢复外观并返还核心；若同时启用实体核心，会先解除实体核心。切换到不同皮肤也会返还旧核心。",
            "en_us": "With both hands empty, sneak-right-click to revert and recover the core. An active entity core is reverted first. Switching to a different skin also returns the old core."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "skin_notes",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "使用注意",
        "en_us": "Things to Know"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [1.5, 3.0, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:skin_core_4",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.0, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:skin_core_18",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "皮肤只换外观，不影响舰型数值——速度、装甲、槽位全由舰装核心决定。",
            "en_us": "Skins are cosmetic only — speed, armor and slots all come from the ship core, never the skin."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 3.2, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "皮肤显示在玩家模型上；舰装的船体和武器层另行渲染，不改变玩家本体的碰撞箱。",
            "en_us": "The skin renders on the player model. Rigging hull and weapon layers render separately and do not change the player's hitbox."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.4, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "同一时刻只能装备一个皮肤。皮肤状态绑定玩家存档，死亡或重进游戏都不会丢。",
            "en_us": "Only one skin can be active at a time. The active skin is bound to your player data — it survives death and relogs."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
